  "summary_en": "Kenya's national AI strategy for 2025-2030 aims to make Kenya Africa's leading AI hub. It rests on three pillars (digital infrastructure, data, AI research and innovation) and four enablers (governance, talent, investment, ethics and inclusion). It notes Kenya has no AI-specific law and proposes an agile governance framework. It has essentially no robotics content.",
